<title>USA: Tadiran sets initial interim dividend.</title>
<headline>Tadiran sets initial interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd said Wednesday it set an interim 1996 dividend of $0.50 per ordinary share payable on December 26 to shareholders of record as of December 16.</p>
<p>The company said this is Tadiran Telecommunication Ltd's initial dividend.  </p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  212 859-1610</p>
